<title>UK: Premier makes Indonesia oil, gas find.</title>
<headline>Premier makes Indonesia oil, gas find.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British oil and gas company Premier Oil Plc said on Thursday that it has made a new oil and gas discovery in the Kakap Block in Indonesia.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the Ketam well is the second discovery made in the Kakap Block since the company bought an 18.75 percent interest as part of its purchase of Disovery Petroleum.</p>
<p>Premier shares were 2-1/4p down at 44p at 1420 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
